A common stock reserved for issuance under the options, some of which were granted pursuant to our 2021 Equity Incentive Plan (the &ldquo;2021
Plan&rdquo;) and some of which were granted outside of the 2021 Plan but were subject to stockholder approval that was previously obtained;
and</FONT></TD></TR>

<TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
