                                            plan to continue to generate a portion of our revenues from advertising and sponsorship during
                                            our esports events. If we are unable to attract more advertisers and sponsors to our gaming
                                            platform, tournaments or competitions, our revenues may be adversely affected.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

