<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><TR STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.5in"></TD><TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">one
                                            or more block transactions, including transactions in which the broker or dealer so engaged
                                            will attempt to sell the shares of Class A common stock as agent but may position and resell
                                            a portion of the block as principal to facilitate the transaction, or in crosses, in which
                                            the same broker acts as an agent on both sides of the trade;</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

